Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.71,0:59:36.48,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,有个人 穿着黑色斗篷…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was this guy,uh,black cloak...{\r}
