Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.32,0:59:43.69,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就在开车之前 不知道这个对你们有没有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the ride started if that's helpful in any way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.72,0:59:45.59,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我们会在乎你的嘲笑吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think we care if you laugh at us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.62,0:59:47.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这关系到我们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our lives,OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.16,0:59:49.42,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有选择 你就直说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What choice do we have? Just give into it?{\r}
