Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:54.20,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的意思是说死神好像一个人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK,wait,are you guys saying that Death is,like,a person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.23,0:59:56.86,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是一种力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's like...like a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.90,1:00:00.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 力量只是力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Well,you know what? A force is just a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.64,1:00:03.11,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,没别的 只是能量转换而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing else. Just transferred energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.14,1:00:06.60,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 力量没有目标性 没有自主意识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,it has no goals,no awareness that is a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.65,1:00:08.31,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,但这件事有自主意识 麦金利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is awareness,McKinley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.35,1:00:10.78,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,根据过去的经验 如果这条线的下一个人获救…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln fact,in past cases,if the next in line is saved...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.82,1:00:13.08,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,这个人就逃脱了死神的索命 这就是我们来这的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'd skip that person. That's why we're here.{\r}
