Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.85,1:00:47.61,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我说小心那些箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I said watch the boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.65,1:00:49.28,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 干什么? 他们什么也干不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? What for? They're not doing anything.{\r}
