Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.29,1:00:56.16,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你们还没有看到或经历我们经历的 暂时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't seen or been through what we have...yet.{\r}
