Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.92,1:01:28.22,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最上层 - 生物功能的终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Top shelf. - the end of biological function.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.26,1:01:29.25,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as simple as that.{\r}
