Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:49.31,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,凯文 那些纯粹死于心脏病的人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kevin,how come when a guy dies of a plain heart attack...{\r}
