Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.22,1:02:00.75,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么 这听上去就像疯子在说话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why? Because they'd sound crazy...{\r}
