Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.73,1:02:08.06,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,- 钉完我们就走 - 好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- so we can get out of here. - OK!{\r}
