Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.81,1:03:55.77,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,就算按照你们的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go with what you guys are saying.{\r}
