Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.53,1:18:12.29,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,你是下一个对不对? 你是最后一个人 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're next,right? You're the end of it,aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.33,1:18:13.73,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 我好像也有妄想症了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,I would be paranoid,too.{\r}
