Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.44,1:18:23.67,chs&eng,,0000,0000,0000,,"必须" 太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Have to"? Wow,that's extreme.{\r}
